    Bug 2017206 - Validate selected S/MIME encryption cert at selection time in Account Settings. r=kaie,mkmelin,tobyp


    Validate the selected S/MIME encryption certificate immediately in Account Settings.

    Use shared helper smimeVerifyCert() in smimeSelectCert with
    asyncVerifyCertAtTime(verifyUsageEmailRecipient).

    If verification fails, show the existing certificate error message and do not
    apply the selected certificate. This prevents unsupported encryption certs
    from being silently accepted until manual Test/send time.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D283648

